# Paths that belong to the Chassis repository but never to a generated
# project. create-chassis reads this file from the template it downloads.
#
# That matters because the CLI is versioned separately from the template it
# fetches: a CLI published last month still downloads today's master. When the
# exclusion list lived only in the CLI, adding a top-level directory leaked it
# into every project made by every already-published version. Declaring it here
# fixes all of them at once, with no CLI release.
#
# A bare name matches any file or directory with that basename.
# An entry containing "/" matches a path relative to the repository root.

# Published alongside the template, but not part of it.
cli
site
mcp-server

# Deploys the Chassis documentation site; a generated project has no site/.
.github/workflows/docs.yml
